        <activityName xml:lang="en">Pellets, iron, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Pellets, iron, at plant
Input/output data from three pellet plant sites in the EU-25.\nNo transport of iron ore because pellets are fabricated at mine;
Synonyms: In UVEK2018 enthalten; 
UUID: d7f5d3ed-f24a-3238-b461-cd967c449816
Blending, mixing and sintering. Emissions are abated
Location: Inputs relate to three pellent plant sites in EU-25. Emissions relate to European plants.; Data from literature, referring to Europe
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from literature 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d7f5d3ed-f24a-3238-b461-cd967c449816.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
